sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as User Admin
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>UsersPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>SearchUserAccountsBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>SearchUserAccountsController
  participant User as «entity»<br/>User
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: search and filter accounts
  UI->>B: GET /api/admin/users (JWT)
  B->>C: search(String keyword, Role role, AccountStatus status, boolean includeDeleted, Pageable pageable)
  C->>User: search()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C-->>B: PageResponse<AdminUserResponse>
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result